  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yaaqoob Esaawuun Wal arguuf Qophaaʼe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaqoobis karaa isaa itti fufe; ergamoonni Waaqayyoos isatti dhufan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis yommuu isaan argetti, \"Kun buufata Waaqaa ti\" jedhe; iddoo sanas Mahanayiim jedhee moggaase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaqoobis gara obboleessa isaa Esaawu kan biyya Edoom lafa Seeʼiir jedhamu keessa jiraatuutti ergamoota of dura erge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis akkana jedhee isaan ajaje: \"Isin gooftaa koo Esaawuun akkana jedhaa: 'Garbichi kee Yaaqoob akkana jedha; ani Laabaa bira jiraadhee hamma ammaattis isuma biran ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani loonii fi harroota, hoolotaa fi reʼoota, hojjettoota dhiiraatii fi dubartootas qaba. Ammas ani fuula kee duratti surraa akkan argadhuuf ergaa kana gooftaa kootti nan erga.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergamoonni sunis gara Yaaqoobitti deebiʼanii, \"Nu obboleessa kee Esaawu bira dhaqneerra; innis si simachuuf dhufaa jira; namoonni dhibba afur isa wajjin jiru\" jedhaniin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaqoobis akka malee sodaatee dhiphate; namoota isa wajjin turanis garee lamatti qoode; bushaayee, loowwanii fi gaalawwan illee akkasuma garee lamatti qoode.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis, \"Yoo Esaawu dhufee garee tokko dhaʼe, gareen kaan jalaa baʼa\" jedhee yaade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaqoob akkana jedhee kadhate; \"Yaa Waaqa abbaa koo Abrahaam, Waaqa abbaa koo Yisihaaq, yaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.32.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", isa 'Ati gara biyya keetii fi gara firoota keetiitti deebiʼi, ani waan gaarii siifin godhaa' naan jette sun,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ani gaarummaa fi amanamummaa ati ana garbicha kee argisiifte kana hundaaf hin malu. Ani yeroo Yordaanos kana ceʼetti ulee koo qofa qaban ture; amma garuu garee lama taʼeen jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani akka ati harka obboleessa koo Esaawu jalaa na baastu sin kadhadha. Ani, 'Inni dhufee na ajjeesa; haadhotas ijoollee isaanii wajjin ni ajjeesa' jedhee sodaadheeraatii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati garuu, 'Ani dhugumaan waan gaarii siifin godha; sanyii kees akka cirracha galaanaa kan lakkaaʼamuu hin dandeenye sanaa nan godha' jetteerta.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni halkan sana achuma bule; waan of biraa qabu keessaas kennaa obboleessa isaa Esaawuuf kennu filate;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isaanis reʼoota dhaltuu dhibba lama, korbeeyyii reʼee digdama, hoolota dhaltuu dhibba lama, korbeeyyii hoolaa digdama,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaalawwan dhalaa soddoma ilmaan isaanii wajjin, saawwan afurtama, jiboota loonii kudhan, harroota dhaltuu digdama, wadala harrootaa kudhan turan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis karra karraan addaan baasee tajaajiltoota isaatti kennee, \"Na dura darbaa deemaa; karrawwan horii gidduuttis lafa hambisaa\" jedhee tajaajiltoota isaa ajaje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha fuula duraan jiru sanaanis akkana jedhe: \"Yoo Esaaw obboleessi koo sitti dhufe, 'Ati kan eenyuu ti? Eessa dhaqxa? Horiin fuula kee dura jiru kun kan eenyuu ti?' jedhee si gaafate,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati, 'Kan garbicha kee Yaaqoob. Isaanis kennaa gooftaa koo Esaawuuf ergamanii dha; kunoo, Yaaqoobis nu duubaan dhufaa jira' jechuu qabda.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha lammaffaa, sadaffaa fi warra karrawwan sana faana deeman hundas akkana jedhee ajaje; \"Isinis yoo Esaawun argitan waanuma kana isatti himaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akkasumas, 'Kunoo garbichi kee Yaaqoob nu duubaan dhufaa jira' jedhaa.\" Inni, \"Ani kennaa of dura ergeef kanaan isa nan araarfadha; ergasii immoo ani yommuun isa argutti tarii inni na simata taʼa\" jedhee yaadee tureetii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kennaan Yaaqoobiis isa dura darbe; Yaaqoob garuu halkan sana qubata sana keessa bule.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yaaqoob Waaqa Walʼaansoo Qabe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halkanuma sana Yaaqoob kaʼee niitota isaa lamaan, xomboreewwan isaa lamaanii fi ilmaan isaa kudha tokko fudhatee malkaa Yaaboq ceʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis erga laga isaan ceesisee booddee qabeenya isaa hunda erge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaqoob immoo kophaa isaa hafe; namichi tokkos hamma lafti bariitutti walʼaansoo isa qabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichis yommuu akka Yaaqoobin moʼachuu hin dandeenye argetti, buusaa luqqeettuu Yaaqoob tuqe; yeroo inni namicha wajjin walʼaansoo qabettis luqqeettuun Yaaqoob ni adoode.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichis, \"Waan bariʼuu gaʼeef gad na dhiisi\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 32:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yaaqoob garuu, \"Yoo ati na eebbifte malee ani gad si hin dhiisu\" jedhee deebise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichis, \"Maqaan kee eenyu\" jedhee isa gaafate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 32:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inni immoo, \"Yaaqoob\" jedhee deebise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichis, \"Ati sababii Waaqaa fi namoota wajjin walʼaansoo qabdee moʼatteef siʼachi Israaʼel jedhamta malee Yaaqoob hin jedhamtu\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
